(7757442, 1283680, 114285, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to say that this will be disqualified. I thought I emailed the photo to myself whilst I was away. I kept chopping and changing which image I was going to enter into the free study and in a momentarily lapse of confusion  I completely forgot to forward the original to my email. In the meantime, I had edited the photo with my camera phone. Usually I save the original, I dont know what happened this time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-09-11 07:19:23.</i></td>', 'I am sorry to say that this will be disqualified. I thought I emailed the photo to myself whilst I was away. I kept chopping and changing which image I was going to enter into the free study and in a momentarily lapse of confusion  I completely forgot to forward the original to my email. In the meantime, I had edited the photo with my camera phone. Usually I save the original, I dont know what happened this time.', '2023-09-11 08:17:32.000000', '2023-09-11 08:19:23.000000', 0),
